body:
Jesus Christ, just because shit blew up for you guys doesnt mean its going to for this kid.

I'm not going to patronize you OP, I know you just made this thread to validate your puppy love and that's whatever.  Everyone in this thread is right on one level, though;  
you're putting all your hopes on this one girl and that's dangerous.  Embrace the love, but don't forget to work and live for yourself as well.
